On-device AI means AI (like image recognition, speech processing, etc.) is built directly into a device, like a smartphone or tablet, instead of relying on cloud services. This means the device itself handles the data processing, making it more efficient and user-friendly. It’s about empowering devices to do tasks autonomously, like playing games or analyzing data on their own.

